  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Response to Hurricanes Irma and Maria in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide effective response to meet immediate humanitarian needs in the wake of Hurricanes Irma and Maria in the Caribbean. Funding will primarily focus on shelter, protection, WASH (water, sanitation and health) and early recovery</narrative>
  </description>
